(6125357, 902452, 67553, '<td valign="top">This is a really well done shot and I think will do quite well.  My only complaint would be that I find the brighter colors on the left and in the bottle distracting from the main subject. I like the way you were able to focus on the eye and really bring out the reflections and emotion in it while giving a soft fuzzy OOF feel to the fur.</td>', 'This is a really well done shot and I think will do quite well.  My only complaint would be that I find the brighter colors on the left and in the bottle distracting from the main subject. I like the way you were able to focus on the eye and really bring out the reflections and emotion in it while giving a soft fuzzy OOF feel to the fur.', '2010-08-09 23:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125360, 901285, 67553, '<td valign="top">I really, really, really want to like this shot!  The ''pose'' (for want of a better word) is priceless, but the shot could use some work.  The image is soft overall and the leaf on the right could have been cropped out in such a way as to bring the squirrel in closer as the main subject and also put him in more of a ''rule of thirds'' position.  As is I''m going with a 6, but I think this subject could have rated an 8 or 9.</td>', 'I really, really, really want to like this shot!  The ''pose'' (for want of a better word) is priceless, but the shot could use some work.  The image is soft overall and the leaf on the right could have been cropped out in such a way as to bring the squirrel in closer as the main subject and also put him in more of a ''rule of thirds'' position.  As is I''m going with a 6, but I think this subject could have rated an 8 or 9.', '2010-08-10 00:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
