(6125691, 901756, 63150, '<td valign="top">This is really well done.  Nice subject, lighting and emotion!</td>', 'This is really well done.  Nice subject, lighting and emotion!', '2010-08-10 10:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125692, 902419, 63150, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Nice capture, nice lighting crisp. good job!</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Nice capture, nice lighting crisp. good job!', '2010-08-10 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125703, 902419, 69368, '<td valign="top">i love this image! It made me smile!</td>', 'i love this image! It made me smile!', '2010-08-10 10:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125825, 902182, 120027, '<td valign="top">Colour is purrfect</td>', 'Colour is purrfect', '2010-08-10 12:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125862, 901652, 119619, '<td valign="top">hahahahahahh good shot</td>', 'hahahahahahh good shot', '2010-08-10 12:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125863, 901255, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice close up - B&amp;W works really well on this.<br/> <br/>really sox it to them ;-)</td>', 'nice close up - B&W works really well on this. really sox it to them ;-)', '2010-08-10 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125902, 902484, 118396, '<td valign="top">But she must have gotten her hair from her daddy!  Wow!  Really cute.</td>', 'But she must have gotten her hair from her daddy!  Wow!  Really cute.', '2010-08-10 13:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125966, 901944, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of bokeh to highlight your subjects. I like the choice of B&amp;W here, as it really helps to show the details in the fur. The one major downside is the hands visible. You did a good job cropping more of the hands out, but it could have been really great if we couldn''t see them at at..</td>', 'Nice use of bokeh to highlight your subjects. I like the choice of B&W here, as it really helps to show the details in the fur. The one major downside is the hands visible. You did a good job cropping more of the hands out, but it could have been really great if we couldn''t see them at at..', '2010-08-10 14:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125967, 902487, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for this challenge. Nice color and good balance to this. I wonder if you are getting low scores because it''s hard to tell if this is really a baby (the face actually makes it look mature).</td>', 'Interesting choice for this challenge. Nice color and good balance to this. I wonder if you are getting low scores because it''s hard to tell if this is really a baby (the face actually makes it look mature).', '2010-08-10 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125969, 901997, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Good amount of detail and sharpness. Good use of the rule of thirds for the baby''s face.</td>', 'Nice photo. Good amount of detail and sharpness. Good use of the rule of thirds for the baby''s face.', '2010-08-10 14:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125971, 902415, 114225, '<td valign="top">A unique animal to entire into this challenge. NIce job capturing details in the fur. the bright red "dish" is somewhat distracting. I wonder if desaturating the red a bit would have helped.</td>', 'A unique animal to entire into this challenge. NIce job capturing details in the fur. the bright red "dish" is somewhat distracting. I wonder if desaturating the red a bit would have helped.', '2010-08-10 14:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125974, 902298, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute capture. Nice use of depth of field. I get the feeling this photo was sharpened a lot (maybe it''s just the way the fur looks, but the local contrast feels a bit too high).</td>', 'Cute capture. Nice use of depth of field. I get the feeling this photo was sharpened a lot (maybe it''s just the way the fur looks, but the local contrast feels a bit too high).', '2010-08-10 14:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125976, 902227, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a young family. Great amount of details, good colors, and nice use of depth of field. For me, the crop (top/bottom) feels a bit tight.</td>', 'Great capture of a young family. Great amount of details, good colors, and nice use of depth of field. For me, the crop (top/bottom) feels a bit tight.', '2010-08-10 14:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125983, 901411, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for this challenge. You certainly don''t see many shots from this angle. My main suggestion for this would be to not use center composition. If you could have put the cubs at the bottom of the photo, so the viewer could get a sense of what they were looking into, that would have been great.</td>', 'Interesting choice for this challenge. You certainly don''t see many shots from this angle. My main suggestion for this would be to not use center composition. If you could have put the cubs at the bottom of the photo, so the viewer could get a sense of what they were looking into, that would have been great.', '2010-08-10 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125989, 902183, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Good sharpness of the subject and nice background blur.<br/>I''m not so sure I like the border effect used. It makes it feel like the main part of the photo is washed out.</td>', 'Nice photo. Good sharpness of the subject and nice background blur.I''m not so sure I like the border effect used. It makes it feel like the main part of the photo is washed out.', '2010-08-10 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125993, 901768, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It''s cool how you can see it''s foot kicking behind him.<br/>The photo has the feeling of too much sharpening, especially in the furry feathers. I see this because there are some very brights parts the the feathers that look unnatural.</td>', 'Nice capture. It''s cool how you can see it''s foot kicking behind him.The photo has the feeling of too much sharpening, especially in the furry feathers. I see this because there are some very brights parts the the feathers that look unnatural.', '2010-08-10 14:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125996, 902296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Great use of the rule of thirds, and I like the vignetting used.</td>', 'Good capture. Great use of the rule of thirds, and I like the vignetting used.', '2010-08-10 14:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125997, 902508, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture. For the crop used, the center composition works well. It helps to show how expansive the landscape is around them.</td>', 'Great capture. For the crop used, the center composition works well. It helps to show how expansive the landscape is around them.', '2010-08-10 14:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6125998, 901315, 114225, '<td valign="top">Amazing clarity in the eyes. Good mix of detail/softness in the fur. I like the border effect used in this photo.</td>', 'Amazing clarity in the eyes. Good mix of detail/softness in the fur. I like the border effect used in this photo.', '2010-08-10 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126000, 901503, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Good use of props, and very nice lighting.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Good use of props, and very nice lighting.', '2010-08-10 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126001, 902401, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like it! Most photos with the back turned to the photographer don''t turn out well, but with the moth in the shot, we get the feeling of looking from her perspective.<br/>My only gripe is the vignetting used. To me, it''s a bit heavy, especially with the amount of color banding it has created.</td>', 'I like it! Most photos with the back turned to the photographer don''t turn out well, but with the moth in the shot, we get the feeling of looking from her perspective.My only gripe is the vignetting used. To me, it''s a bit heavy, especially with the amount of color banding it has created.', '2010-08-10 14:50:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6126005, 902419, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture (very good composition, color, and clarity). The look in its eyes (with the ears pressed back) really show that it is unsure about those dandelions.</td>', 'Really nice capture (very good composition, color, and clarity). The look in its eyes (with the ears pressed back) really show that it is unsure about those dandelions.', '2010-08-10 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126008, 902388, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, and I really like the title!<br/>The composition is spot on (giving the mom room to walk into the frame.<br/>Great amount of details and good colors.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, and I really like the title!The composition is spot on (giving the mom room to walk into the frame.Great amount of details and good colors.', '2010-08-10 14:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126010, 902178, 114225, '<td valign="top">Super cute. That eye looking out gives an extra dimension to the photo. Center composition was a good choice here.</td>', 'Super cute. That eye looking out gives an extra dimension to the photo. Center composition was a good choice here.', '2010-08-10 14:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126015, 902498, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hehe, love the title :)<br/>Unfortunately, the photo isn''t as great as the title.You did do a good job getting the eyes in focus and using background blue. But the hand covering most of the animal is just too distracting for me.</td>', 'Hehe, love the title :)Unfortunately, the photo isn''t as great as the title.You did do a good job getting the eyes in focus and using background blue. But the hand covering most of the animal is just too distracting for me.', '2010-08-10 14:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126019, 902115, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture in a natural environment. Brilliant details and good diffused lighting (I''m betting it was an overcast day).</td>', 'Great capture in a natural environment. Brilliant details and good diffused lighting (I''m betting it was an overcast day).', '2010-08-10 14:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126022, 901890, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh my, those eyes! What a wonderful capture. Nice job getting down to it''s level,and getting great clarity and use of background blur.</td>', 'Oh my, those eyes! What a wonderful capture. Nice job getting down to it''s level,and getting great clarity and use of background blur.', '2010-08-10 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126025, 902179, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great look in its eye. Kind of a combination of tired and mischievous.</td>', 'Great look in its eye. Kind of a combination of tired and mischievous.', '2010-08-10 14:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126029, 901935, 114225, '<td valign="top">Haha! The look on his face is priceless! It''s too bad the image is so blurred, this could have been a fantastic shot!</td>', 'Haha! The look on his face is priceless! It''s too bad the image is so blurred, this could have been a fantastic shot!', '2010-08-10 14:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126078, 902406, 46918, '<td valign="top">That''s a new concept...a kangaroo on a string...lol</td>', 'That''s a new concept...a kangaroo on a string...lol', '2010-08-10 15:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126082, 902214, 46918, '<td valign="top">looks like there is too much contrast</td>', 'looks like there is too much contrast', '2010-08-10 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126084, 901363, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective... The lighting is even good.</td>', 'I love the perspective... The lighting is even good.', '2010-08-10 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126111, 902381, 59267, '<td valign="top">cool! 10</td>', 'cool! 10', '2010-08-10 16:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126117, 902314, 59267, '<td valign="top">Wow! perfect lighting and setup. This is blue ribbon to me!</td>', 'Wow! perfect lighting and setup. This is blue ribbon to me!', '2010-08-10 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126131, 902388, 35994, '<td valign="top">LOL! What a cute pose &amp; a perfect title!!</td>', 'LOL! What a cute pose & a perfect title!!', '2010-08-10 16:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126164, 902419, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love it...Great expression on his face, nice colors, I like the dof.</td>', 'I love it...Great expression on his face, nice colors, I like the dof.', '2010-08-10 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126178, 901279, 91783, '<td valign="top">JENNIFER!!!!! nice to see that you entered the challenge! hopefully you will get top 10 or something fantastic like that... =D (not voting)</td>', 'JENNIFER!!!!! nice to see that you entered the challenge! hopefully you will get top 10 or something fantastic like that... =D (not voting)', '2010-08-10 17:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126183, 901251, 114225, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo. It''s great how the building makes the little cat seem even smaller. Good choice for B&amp;W on this one.</td>', 'Brilliant photo. It''s great how the building makes the little cat seem even smaller. Good choice for B&W on this one.', '2010-08-10 17:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126185, 902395, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, clarity, and color. Great job catching the action, and I really like the title.</td>', 'Excellent composition, clarity, and color. Great job catching the action, and I really like the title.', '2010-08-10 17:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126186, 902517, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of background blur and a really nice time of day to take the photo (good shadows and warm colors). Also, great focus/details on the calf.</td>', 'Good use of background blur and a really nice time of day to take the photo (good shadows and warm colors). Also, great focus/details on the calf.', '2010-08-10 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126187, 902210, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great setup, lighting, and perspective. It''s too bad this has the feeling of over-sharpening (especially around the eyes), because it could have been really great with a more natural feel.</td>', 'Great setup, lighting, and perspective. It''s too bad this has the feeling of over-sharpening (especially around the eyes), because it could have been really great with a more natural feel.', '2010-08-10 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126188, 901296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Super cute! Great job on the soft lighting, low perspective, and composition. I really like the choice of B&amp;W for this photo.</td>', 'Super cute! Great job on the soft lighting, low perspective, and composition. I really like the choice of B&W for this photo.', '2010-08-10 17:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126190, 902500, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details and depth of field. Good job with exposure in a difficult to meter environment.</td>', 'Great details and depth of field. Good job with exposure in a difficult to meter environment.', '2010-08-10 17:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126192, 902439, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh no! You had the perfect setup, great colors, and what looks to be good details (focus looks spot on). This photo likely would have gotten an 8, 9, or even 10 from me if it weren''t for the super sharpening. The pixelation does give it a bit of an artsy feel, but I would have liked it much more with a natural feel.</td>', 'Oh no! You had the perfect setup, great colors, and what looks to be good details (focus looks spot on). This photo likely would have gotten an 8, 9, or even 10 from me if it weren''t for the super sharpening. The pixelation does give it a bit of an artsy feel, but I would have liked it much more with a natural feel.', '2010-08-10 17:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126194, 902364, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job getting so much scenery in this photo to setup the context. That adds a ton to this photo.</td>', 'Great job getting so much scenery in this photo to setup the context. That adds a ton to this photo.', '2010-08-10 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126195, 901282, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great pet portrait. Center composition works very well, the facial expression is great, and the setting is unobtrusive. Well done!</td>', 'Great pet portrait. Center composition works very well, the facial expression is great, and the setting is unobtrusive. Well done!', '2010-08-10 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126197, 902275, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Good use of negative space to give him something to "walk into". Also, very good details.</td>', 'Great photo. Good use of negative space to give him something to "walk into". Also, very good details.', '2010-08-10 17:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126199, 901485, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great shot with those little claws gripping the wood. Good clarity and nice composition.</td>', 'Great shot with those little claws gripping the wood. Good clarity and nice composition.', '2010-08-10 17:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126200, 901650, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition to this one (has great balance with the reflection). Unfortunately, the lack of clarity is really hurting the overall photo.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition to this one (has great balance with the reflection). Unfortunately, the lack of clarity is really hurting the overall photo.', '2010-08-10 17:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
