(6126295, 902314, 74911, '<td valign="top">I see a strong possibility of top 10 or even 5 here. Great in all respects.</td>', 'I see a strong possibility of top 10 or even 5 here. Great in all respects.', '2010-08-10 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
