(6130452, 902513, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Eyes kind of look evil like that though. They don''t seem like a natural color.</td>', 'Very sharp. Eyes kind of look evil like that though. They don''t seem like a natural color.', '2010-08-15 13:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
