(6132046, 902439, 40391, '<td valign="top">I actually liked the processing as I thought the idea was to try and create the same textural (if that''s a word) feel with the kittens, the ground, the background and even the bowl.  To me it was different in an artistic manner and made me stop and look for longer.  I gave this a 7 and probably would have given the less processed shot 6.</td>', 'I actually liked the processing as I thought the idea was to try and create the same textural (if that''s a word) feel with the kittens, the ground, the background and even the bowl.  To me it was different in an artistic manner and made me stop and look for longer.  I gave this a 7 and probably would have given the less processed shot 6.', '2010-08-16 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 0),
