(6132448, 902359, 811, '<td valign="top">I love mollies, but alas, they don''t seem to do well in our aquarium.  We had one birth one time, but the babies were, um, consumed rather quickly.  If we ever try again, I''m going to set up a separate birthing tank, I think.</td>', 'I love mollies, but alas, they don''t seem to do well in our aquarium.  We had one birth one time, but the babies were, um, consumed rather quickly.  If we ever try again, I''m going to set up a separate birthing tank, I think.', '2010-08-17 01:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
