(6132615, 902514, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CreativeFlyPhoto:</b></div><hr/><i> too bad this isnt in focus </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank GOD this isn''t in focus... that''s the whole point!!!!!! I''m personally sick of everyone thinking that everything HAS TO BE IN FOCUS... lol (I''ve had too much coffee this morning) but I did give this a 10 and it''s amazingly underrated!</td>', 'Originally posted by CreativeFlyPhoto: too bad this isnt in focus   Thank GOD this isn''t in focus... that''s the whole point!!!!!! I''m personally sick of everyone thinking that everything HAS TO BE IN FOCUS... lol (I''ve had too much coffee this morning) but I did give this a 10 and it''s amazingly underrated!', '2010-08-17 10:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
