(6132861, 902389, 117474, '<td valign="top">Whoah. No comments. <br/>This is in the weird situation where the competition participants scored you higher than the non-participants, all users and commenters. Guess they didn''t find your bison a threat :)<br/> <br/>I gave you a 4. It felt pretty washed out to me, and the baby wasn''t very interesting. Basically your pre-challenge anticipations. <br/>There was something about the green that simply looked odd or wrong to me. Not quite sure what it was. Maybe our grass in Ireland''s different to yours. I dunno. It seemed slightly unnatural, which didn''t frame the shot too good as a first impression, hence, I''d say, my under-par scoring.</td>', 'Whoah. No comments. This is in the weird situation where the competition participants scored you higher than the non-participants, all users and commenters. Guess they didn''t find your bison a threat :) I gave you a 4. It felt pretty washed out to me, and the baby wasn''t very interesting. Basically your pre-challenge anticipations. There was something about the green that simply looked odd or wrong to me. Not quite sure what it was. Maybe our grass in Ireland''s different to yours. I dunno. It seemed slightly unnatural, which didn''t frame the shot too good as a first impression, hence, I''d say, my under-par scoring.', '2010-08-17 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 0),
