(6143783, 902514, 102315, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by love:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CreativeFlyPhoto:</b></div><hr/><i> too bad this isnt in focus </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank GOD this isn''t in focus... that''s the whole point!!!!!! I''m personally sick of everyone thinking that everything HAS TO BE IN FOCUS... lol (I''ve had too much coffee this morning) but I did give this a 10 and it''s amazingly underrated! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was one of the 7''s given. I thought this image had great impact and it''s because it''s not in focus. There is a great difference between bad OOF and good OOF. Good OOF has artistic impact as this image clearly does. Bad OOF is a family portrait that is not sharp.</td>', 'Originally posted by love: Originally posted by CreativeFlyPhoto: too bad this isnt in focus   Thank GOD this isn''t in focus... that''s the whole point!!!!!! I''m personally sick of everyone thinking that everything HAS TO BE IN FOCUS... lol (I''ve had too much coffee this morning) but I did give this a 10 and it''s amazingly underrated!   I was one of the 7''s given. I thought this image had great impact and it''s because it''s not in focus. There is a great difference between bad OOF and good OOF. Good OOF has artistic impact as this image clearly does. Bad OOF is a family portrait that is not sharp.', '2010-08-28 13:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
